    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="6">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Wif">Wif</ref> 6</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif hy þonne ælces þinges sammæle beon, ðonne fon magas to 7 weddian heora magan to wife 7 to rihtlife ðam ðe hire girnde; 7 fo to þæm borge se ðe ðæs weddes waldend sy.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If they then reach agreement about everything, then the kinsmen are to set about betrothing their kinswoman as wife and in lawful matrimony to him who has asked for her, and he who is the leader of the betrothal is to receive the security.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif hy ðonne ælces ðinges sammæle beon, ðonne fon magas to 7 wedian heora magan to wife 7 to rihtlife ðam ðe hire gyrnde; 7 fo to ðam borge se ðe ðæs weddes waldend sy.</ab>
      </div>
